{"lyrics":"[Intro]\n[00:02.56]Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah\n[00:03.08]Okay (Wheezy Beats)\n[00:11.16]Um, in her mouth like a dentist, filling in\n[00:14.68]Hold on, what I say after that, I'ma fuckin' kill this shit\n[00:16.64]Um, in her mouth like a dentist, filling in, in\n[00:23.94]Okay\n[Verse]\n[00:25.02]In her mouth like a dentist, filling in\n[00:28.28]I fuck her good, just to make her feel my sins\n[00:31.70]I pray to God, need him to forgive my sins\n[00:35.18]I go and get high, get low, then get high again\n[00:38.52]I'm in her mouth like a dentist, filling in\n[00:41.94]I fuck her good, make her feel all my sins\n[00:45.40]I'm on my knees, need him to forgive my sins\n[00:48.88]I get high, get low, then get high again\n[00:54.54]Pop a pill so I could feel real for a second\n[00:58.40]Handy Manny tool, drill when I'm reckless\n[01:01.40]Sipping big lean like I was raised down in Texas\n[01:04.82]Bitch, I'm straight flexin'\n[01:06.58]Diamonds cowboys, heehawing on my necklace\n[01:10.12]I feel like I'm reckless\n[01:11.68]Pull up with a TEC, to slam a nigga like some Tekken\n[01:14.82]I was sipping on the Tech, I get high in a couple seconds\n[01:18.54]Ballin' like Spalding and I don't really do no talkin'\n[01:22.14]I give her a D, and then I follow with the offense\n[01:25.00]She tell me my dick is awesome, but my attitude is awful\n[01:28.96]I feel like I'm Dahmer, get it? I'm a fuckin' monster\n[01:31.82]Nigga you don't want no problem\n[01:34.12]I work with them robbers, and them demons, and them goblins\n[01:37.50]AP on my wrist is really tick-tock shinin'\n[01:40.98]I feel like I'm Tony Hawk, big skate grindin'\n[01:44.26]Cowboy shit new revolver is shinin'\n[01:48.12]Yeah, I fuck your bitch and never ever land\n[01:52.08]I put the cannon on my wrist, I feel like Mega Man\n[01:55.78]The AK-47 import from Afghanistan\n[01:58.52]I feel like 50 Cent 'cause yes, I know that many men\n[02:02.52]They want to see me dead, they want to see one in my head\n[02:05.96]But I can't go for that, so I got niggas toting lead\n[02:09.40]And they won't go for that, you pull up, they leave you dead\n[02:12.84]Up at my show in fact, we had to knock him in his head\n[02:16.16]'Cause he was talkin' shit, I bet his mama called up feds\n[02:19.44]'Cause he's a walkin' lick, it's not my fault that he was there\n[02:23.12]And yeah, he had to get hit, I guess that nigga—\n[02:50.58]Ooh, I just killed that","words":[[2.56,2.66,"Yeah,"],[2.7,2.76,"yeah,"],[2.8,2.86,"yeah,"],[2.9,3.02,"yeah"],[3.08,3.28,"Okay"],[4.6,4.84,"(Wheezy"],[4.92,11.04,"Beats)"],[11.16,11.26,"Um,"],[11.3,11.36,"in"],[11.44,11.56,"her"],[11.68,12.02,"mouth"],[12.12,12.32,"like"],[12.38,12.38,"a"],[12.54,12.88,"dentist,"],[12.96,13.42,"filling"],[13.88,14.0,"in"],[14.68,14.8,"Hold"],[14.86,14.94,"on,"],[15.08,15.16,"what"],[15.26,15.26,"I"],[15.32,15.42,"say"],[15.46,15.58,"after"],[15.62,15.76,"that,"],[15.82,15.88,"I'ma"],[15.92,16.12,"fuckin'"],[16.24,16.4,"kill"],[16.44,16.5,"this"],[16.54,16.6,"shit"],[16.64,16.66,"Um,"],[16.7,16.72,"in"],[16.76,16.8,"her"],[16.84,16.94,"mouth"],[16.98,17.08,"like"],[17.3,17.3,"a"],[19.36,19.74,"dentist,"],[19.8,20.3,"filling"],[20.34,20.92,"in,"],[21.68,22.12,"in"],[23.94,24.34,"Okay"],[25.02,25.1,"In"],[25.16,25.24,"her"],[25.38,25.68,"mouth"],[25.82,26.0,"like"],[26.16,26.16,"a"],[26.24,26.58,"dentist,"],[26.66,27.14,"filling"],[27.64,27.8,"in"],[28.28,28.28,"I"],[28.38,28.6,"fuck"],[28.64,28.7,"her"],[28.84,29.12,"good,"],[29.24,29.42,"just"],[29.48,29.54,"to"],[29.66,29.88,"make"],[29.92,29.98,"her"],[30.08,30.28,"feel"],[30.4,30.66,"my"],[30.94,31.32,"sins"],[31.7,31.7,"I"],[31.78,31.98,"pray"],[32.06,32.12,"to"],[32.24,32.54,"God,"],[32.68,32.82,"need"],[32.88,32.98,"him"],[33.08,33.16,"to"],[33.3,33.76,"forgive"],[33.84,34.1,"my"],[34.4,34.78,"sins"],[35.18,35.18,"I"],[35.28,35.32,"go"],[35.4,35.44,"and"],[35.52,35.62,"get"],[35.7,36.02,"high,"],[36.1,36.22,"get"],[36.32,36.46,"low,"],[36.52,36.64,"then"],[36.78,36.9,"get"],[3